      "zhCN": "spin/zh-cn/Indicator",
      "enUS": "spin/en-us/Indicator",
      "notes": "保留固定上游参数与交互；Vue props、slots、shallowRef 适配"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": "Delay",
      "zhCN": "spin/zh-cn/Delay",
      "enUS": "spin/en-us/Delay",
      "notes": "中文索引5，英文索引5。英文独有 Controlled（英文索引6）在本例的 en-us 用例内额外覆盖；中文上游把受控切换放在 Delay 示例内。"
    }
  ],
